OL,3,GNEWSARobotic exoskeleton helps boy, 7,
OL,4,Atake first steps
OL,5,
OL,6,FA robotic exoskeleton has enabled a boy
OL,7,Fto walk for the first time, at the age
OL,8,Fof seven - a "just amazing" moment, his
OL,9,Ffamily says.
OL,11,FEllison Fishwick has a rare form of
OL,12,Fepilepsy which has affected his
OL,13,Fstrength and his development, and now
OL,14,Ffundraising work is going on to get the
OL,15,F#65,000 he needs to buy the device.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
