OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSARobotic exoskeleton helps boy, 7,
OL,4,Atake first steps
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis mum Olivia, from Shrewsbury, said
OL,7,Fthe demonstration walking frame,
OL,8,Fdeveloped in Canada, became available
OL,9,Fin the UK this year for the first time,
OL,10,Fand a trial at a special clinic in
OL,11,FWales saw Ellison take his very first
OL,12,Fsteps.
OL,14,FIt was "just amazing" his mum said.
OL,15,F"When you watch videos of other
OL,16,Ffamilies sharing their child's first
OL,17,Fwalk, that's exactly how we felt."
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
